+Added a ``sqlite3`` minion data cache driver, storing cached grains, mine data, and
+job returns in a single SQLite database file under the master's ``cachedir``. This
+gives single-node masters durable cache storage that survives a restart without
+requiring a separate database service; enable it with ``cache: sqlite3``.
